q: title: BNP Paribas Nordic Open: Elias Ymer vs Mikael Ymer, description: This is a polymarket on the tennis match between Elias Ymer and Mikael Ymer in the BNP Paribas Nordic Open, scheduled for October 13 at 4:00AM ET.

This market will resolve to 'Ymer' if Elias Ymer advances against Mikael Ymer.

This market will resolve to 'Ymer' if Mikael Ymer advances against Elias Ymer.

If the match is canceled (not played at all), ends in a tie, or is delayed beyond 7 days from the scheduled date without a winner determined, this market will resolve to 50-50.

If the match ends in a walkover (player withdraws before the start and the other advances automatically), this market will resolve in favor of the player(s) who officially advances to the next round.

The primary resolution source will be official information from the ATP Tour. A consensus of credible reporting may also be used. market_id: 632159 res_data: p1: 0, p2: 1, p3: 0.5. Where p1 corresponds to Ymer, p2 to Ymer, p3 to unknown/50-50. Updates made by the question creator via the bulletin board at 0x65070BE91477460D8A7AeEb94ef92fe056C2f2A7 as described by https://polygonscan.com/tx/0xa14f01b115c4913624fc3f508f960f4dea252758e73c28f5f07f8e19d7bca066 should be considered.,initializer:91430cad2d3975766499717fa0d66a78d814e5c5,ooRequester:65070be91477460d8a7aeeb94ef92fe056c2f2a7